{
  "name": "Draconic Spells",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you roll a 1 or 2 on a damage die for a spell you cast that deals damage of the type associated with your draconic patron, you can reroll the die. You must use the new roll, even if it is a 1 or 2.</p><p>Additionally, you can also replace any of the spells learned through your Mystic Arcana with a spell that deals damage of the type associated with your draconic patron and is of the same spell level as the spell replaced in this manner.</p>",
